    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_91645695dbb66a100bf0",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 73,
      "text": "# 1）自动机构件撞击现象;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_30df141ec40deb389f76",
      "document_start": 74,
      "document_end": 106,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2e8200633039de4c7d6c",
      "document_start": 108,
      "document_end": 133,
      "text": "撞击过程大致可以分为两个阶段：变形阶段和恢复阶段。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c0fd55ddbcf42f29e323",
      "document_start": 133,
      "document_end": 219,
      "text": "当相撞的两个构件开始接触时，沿接触面的公法线方向具有相对速度，由于这个速度的存在，相撞构件因惯性而相互挤压，从而引起变形，直到法向相对速度等于0为止，这一阶段称为变形阶段。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f66d20859efebe7625a8",
      "document_start": 219,
      "document_end": 261,
      "text": "此后，构件靠弹性部分或全部地恢复原形，直到两构件脱离接触为止，这一阶段称为恢复阶段。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f7685b98e98c87a6d618",
      "document_start": 263,
      "document_end": 283,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_37bb2cf865cdb95382d4",
      "document_start": 284,
      "document_end": 299,
      "text": "# 2）正撞击理论的计算公式;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e6a601aed41dd8a594fe",
      "document_start": 300,
      "document_end": 332,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_11791cce1e01b182b6bf",
      "document_start": 334,
      "document_end": 374,
      "text": "这表明撞击后构件的变形完全恢复，两构件撞击前后相对速度的绝对值相等，但符号相反。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c64c3b655dba45c22166",
      "document_start": 374,
      "document_end": 404,
      "text": "两个完全弹性物体之间的撞击就属于这种情况，称为完全弹性撞击。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ffe516df528fb9d182ea",
      "document_start": 406,
      "document_end": 426,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2bf745021a7e1e9e953e",
      "document_start": 427,
      "document_end": 454,
      "text": "# 4.1.1 火炮与自动武器多体系统动力学分析步骤;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b5785eb5cb4183e155b7",
      "document_start": 455,
      "document_end": 487,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4af3700c6aa5bcfbc3d0",
      "document_start": 489,
      "document_end": 555,
      "text": "多体系统动力学是从经典力学基础上发展起来的学科分支，其根本点在于建立适宜于计算机程序求解的数学模型，并寻求高效、稳定的数值求解方法。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5921f1e4319380215114",
      "document_start": 555,
      "document_end": 632,
      "text": "现代计算多体系统动力学分析一般步骤如下：首先建立多体系统的力学模型，再由多体系统力学模型得到多体动力学数学模型，对数学模型进行数值求解，最后分析求解结果。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4c3c30972a89557440e4",
      "document_start": 632,
      "document_end": 713,
      "text": "其中关键技术是数学模型的建立和求解器设计，数学模型的建立是由多体系统力学模型生成多体动力学数学模型，求解器的设计是结合系统建模，采用动力学算法对数学模型进行求解。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_276bd4eefcbdc42ebd23",
      "document_start": 715,
      "document_end": 735,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8b4781a5774eb186ca70",
      "document_start": 736,
      "document_end": 745,
      "text": "# 1）研究目的;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3f63ed6f79623e0b0c06",
      "document_start": 746,
      "document_end": 778,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6c7c6ef1f56eaabeee25",
      "document_start": 780,
      "document_end": 826,
      "text": "模型是对实际动力学系统的描述，而这种描述的形式并不是唯一的，主要取决于其研究目的和研究内容。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0ad838639cdd8237af58",
      "document_start": 826,
      "document_end": 854,
      "text": "例如，当分析自动机主要构件运动特性时，可将其构件作为质点",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0b24d1a0559b44511146",
      "document_start": 856,
      "document_end": 876,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7212b01bcbb00a46b6c6",
      "document_start": 877,
      "document_end": 889,
      "text": "# 2）模型简化与假设;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_07e05f60c23a71da4c6e",
      "document_start": 890,
      "document_end": 922,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b23b2b4d11a0fa0b6161",
      "document_start": 924,
      "document_end": 956,
      "text": "希望建立的模型能包含实际动力学系统的完全信息，是不太可能实现的。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_58865cef11ef8408fb11",
      "document_start": 956,
      "document_end": 986,
      "text": "过多的实体和相互关系，不但难以获得，即使能获得，也难以处理。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_094e2f3272ebf921ad5f",
      "document_start": 986,
      "document_end": 1017,
      "text": "因此，模型建立存在着“简单化”和“精确性”两个相互矛盾的因素。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_724460df6fd1dcbeeffe",
      "document_start": 1017,
      "document_end": 1060,
      "text": "一方面，模型简单可提高计算速度，减少计算量，但过于简化，也会带来模型参数和计算的误差；",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_28bfd1373813cbe57c46",
      "document_start": 1060,
      "document_end": 1113,
      "text": "另一方面，过分详细复杂的模型，不仅计算量大，容易出错，而且由于涉及细节太多，反而导致模型存在过多不确定性。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6f2c4aeaa965ede34009",
      "document_start": 1113,
      "document_end": 1164,
      "text": "因此，进行合理的模型假设与简化十分必要，使模型既简单清晰又有一定精度，能够反映实际系统动力学变化过程。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1a35aff53de92bab33a0",
      "document_start": 1166,
      "document_end": 1186,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5138253567849fd3fc4b",
      "document_start": 1187,
      "document_end": 1199,
      "text": "# 2）模型简化与假设;",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_076b7cb12dd248504da8",
      "document_start": 1200,
      "document_end": 1232,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8125730e63c9588ecf2f",
      "document_start": 1234,
      "document_end": 1242,
      "text": "（2）结构简化。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ce324492d986fe09cdcc",
      "document_start": 1242,
      "document_end": 1264,
      "text": "对于必须建立的部件，可对其构件结构进行简化。",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_17965cc30a4fd60ff801",
      "document_start": 1264,
      "document_end": 1309,
      "text": "不必过分追求构件几何形体的细节部分同实际部件完全一致，只要求模型构件几何形体的质量、质心位",
      "section_id": "section_47deb280bb7b"
    }
  ],
